      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After discussion, this also happens on this world: Urban Zipline ( https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_0300ade5-3e55-4768-8c43-cfb6fd8ddb32 )\nFor clarification, it's fair to consider worlds should not have to worry about erroring out players by accident, especially with a error message that is worded in this manner, therefore I am working with the assumption that this is a VRChat bug; and not something that world or prefabs creators would need to fix independently.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
