      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am the creator of this gimmick.\nWhile the player is grabbing the arrow, the gimmick keeps updating the player's position by calling \"TeleportTo\" every frame.\nMaybe this method is not intended to be used in this way by VRChat.\nHowever, if possible, it would be appreciated if this could be fixed so that it does not crash, since TeleportTo has to be used to maintain the \"zip line\" representation.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
